Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp., licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

Full licence text: https://github.com/IBM/plex/blob/master/LICENSE.txt
Upstream project:  https://github.com/IBM/plex

Only the latin subset is vendored, to keep the house UI small enough to ship
beside every artifact. No modification has been made beyond subsetting.
